{"abstract":[{"text":"The SDK is setting cookies in your web views in order to sync between the native and the web sessions. For that, the SDK has to know you website’s root domain for the HTTP cookie (e.g “.example.com”). Those domains can be set in the HUMAN’s Portal, however, it recommended to set them directly in the SDK’s policy. IMPORTANT: the domain must be the same domain which the Sensor sets cookies in the website. You should verify the correct domain to avoid VID inconsistency issues.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/human\/hshybridapppolicy\/set(webrootdomains:forappid:)"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/human\/hshybridapppolicy\/set(webrootdomains:forappid:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN","doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/documentation\/HUMAN\/HSHybridAppPolicy"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"HUMAN"}],"externalID":"c:@M@HUMAN@objc(cs)HSHybridAppPolicy(im)setWithWebRootDomains:forAppId:","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"set"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"webRootDomains"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"text":"forAppId","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"title":"set(webRootDomains:forAppId:)","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setWithWebRootDomains:forAppId:","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"method"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.perimeterx.mobile-sdk\/